IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cpp-core`
IMPORT `cpp-core-calendar`
IMPORT `cp5-months`
IMPORT `cp5-related-provisions`

-- Tests of the two related provisions that are encoded (cp5-related-provisions.l4). Expected values worked out by hand.
-- The commencement days are stated inputs; the text gives none. The tests use 1 June 2005 and 1 February 2008.

§ `Tests of the related provisions`

§§ `2004, c. 22, s. 23`

-- Ceased to receive the pension on 15 March 2005 because of returning to work, before section 20 came into force (1 June 2005).
#ASSERT `RP 2004 c. 22 s 23 — section 70.1 does not apply in respect of the person` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2005 3 15) (YearMonthDay 2005 6 1)
-- Ceased on the day section 20 came into force: not "before" it.
#ASSERT NOT (`RP 2004 c. 22 s 23 — section 70.1 does not apply in respect of the person` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2005 6 1) (YearMonthDay 2005 6 1))
-- Ceased afterwards.
#ASSERT NOT (`RP 2004 c. 22 s 23 — section 70.1 does not apply in respect of the person` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2006 3 15) (YearMonthDay 2005 6 1))
-- Ceased for another reason.
#ASSERT NOT (`RP 2004 c. 22 s 23 — section 70.1 does not apply in respect of the person` FALSE (YearMonthDay 2005 3 15) (YearMonthDay 2005 6 1))

§§ `2007, c. 11, s. 36`

-- Application made in February 2008 (the month the section came into force): subparagraph (i.1) applies.
#ASSERT `RP 2007 c. 11 s 36 — subparagraph 44(2)(a)(i.1) applies in respect of the application` (YearMonthDay 2008 2 20) (YearMonthDay 2008 2 1) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2007 5 1)
-- Application made in January 2008: it does not.
#ASSERT NOT (`RP 2007 c. 11 s 36 — subparagraph 44(2)(a)(i.1) applies in respect of the application` (YearMonthDay 2008 1 31) (YearMonthDay 2008 2 1) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2007 5 1))
-- A late applicant (subparagraph 44(1)(b)(ii)) deemed disabled in November 2006: 15 months before February 2008 is November 2006, so it applies.
#ASSERT `RP 2007 c. 11 s 36 — subparagraph 44(2)(a)(i.1) applies in respect of the application` (YearMonthDay 2008 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2008 2 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2006 11 30)
-- Deemed disabled in October 2006: 16 months before, too early.
#ASSERT NOT (`RP 2007 c. 11 s 36 — subparagraph 44(2)(a)(i.1) applies in respect of the application` (YearMonthDay 2008 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2008 2 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2006 10 31))
-- Not a late applicant: the 15-month limit is not in play, however early the disability.
#ASSERT `RP 2007 c. 11 s 36 — subparagraph 44(2)(a)(i.1) applies in respect of the application` (YearMonthDay 2008 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2008 2 1) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2000 1 1)
